#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:7
msgid ""
"ANet is installed as a single static binary named ``anet`` (``anet.exe`` "
"on Windows). The installer downloads the binary for the platform, checks "
"it against a signed release manifest, and writes it to a directory on the"
" search path. No compiler, language runtime or superuser privilege is "
"required for a per-user installation. Linux and macOS use the shell "
"script ``install.sh``; Windows uses the PowerShell script ``install.ps1``"
" (see :ref:`intro-install-windows`)."
msgstr ""
"ANet 以名为 ``anet``\\ （Windows 上为 "
"``anet.exe``）的单个静态二进制文件安装。安装程序下载适用于当前平台的二进制文件，依据已签名的发布清单对其校验，并写入搜索路径上的某个目录。按用户安装无需编译器、语言运行时或超级用户权限。Linux"
" 和 macOS 使用 shell 脚本 ``install.sh``；Windows 使用 PowerShell 脚本 "
"``install.ps1``\\ （参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows`）。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:22
#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:357
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "环境要求"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:24
msgid "Supported platforms"
msgstr "支持的平台"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:25
msgid ""
"Linux, macOS, and Windows 10 version 1809 or later or Windows Server 2019"
" or later, each on amd64 and arm64. Windows runs the native Windows "
"build; WSL2 is not required."
msgstr ""
"amd64 与 arm64 架构上的 Linux、macOS，以及 Windows 10 1809 或更高版本、Windows Server "
"2019 或更高版本。Windows 运行原生 Windows 版本，无需 WSL2。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:29
msgid "Tools used by the installer"
msgstr "安装程序使用的工具"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:30
msgid ""
"On Linux and macOS: ``curl``, ``gzip`` (``gunzip``), ``sha256sum`` or "
"``shasum``, and ``ssh-keygen`` from OpenSSH 8.1 or later. The signature "
"check uses ``ssh-keygen``. If it is missing, the installer stops and "
"names the package to install; no option skips the signature check. On "
"Windows: Windows PowerShell 5.1, which Windows includes, and no tool to "
"install."
msgstr ""
"Linux 和 macOS：``curl``、``gzip``\\ （``gunzip``）、``sha256sum`` 或 "
"``shasum``，以及 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本中的 ``ssh-keygen``。签名检查使用 ``ssh-"
"keygen``。如果缺少该工具，安装程序会停止并指出需要安装的软件包；没有任何选项可以跳过签名检查。Windows：Windows 自带的 "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1，无需安装任何工具。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:36
msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:37
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS to the download host. A node needs no inbound connection "
"and no public address."
msgstr "可向下载主机发起出站 HTTPS 连接。节点不需要入站连接，也不需要公网地址。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:43
msgid "Installing with the script"
msgstr "使用脚本安装"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:45
msgid "Run the installer for the current user:"
msgstr "为当前用户运行安装程序："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:51
msgid ""
"The binary is written to ``~/.local/bin/anet``. When that directory is "
"not on the search path, or another ``anet`` comes before it, the "
"installer adds a marked block to the shell profiles that places the "
"directory first (see :ref:`intro-install-path`). An earlier release of "
"``anet`` on the machine is replaced in the same run (see :ref:`intro-"
"install-earlier`). The installer never waits for input."
msgstr ""
"二进制文件写入 ``~/.local/bin/anet``。该目录不在搜索路径中，或搜索路径中另有 ``anet`` 位于其前时，安装脚本在 "
"shell 配置文件中加入一段带标记的内容，把该目录放在最前（参见 :ref:`intro-install-path`）。本机上的早期版本 "
"``anet`` 在同一次运行中被替换（参见 :ref:`intro-install-earlier`）。安装脚本从不等待输入。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:58
msgid ""
"Before anything is written outside a temporary directory, the installer "
"performs these checks. A failure of any check ends the installation and "
"leaves the installed version unchanged."
msgstr "在向临时目录之外写入任何内容之前，安装程序执行以下检查。任何一项检查失败都会终止安装，并保持已安装的版本不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:62
msgid "``release.json`` carries a valid signature by the ANet release key."
msgstr "``release.json`` 带有 ANet 发布密钥的有效签名。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:63
msgid "The manifest has not expired."
msgstr "清单未过期。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:64
msgid ""
"The manifest does not name a version older than the ``anet`` already "
"installed at the destination."
msgstr "清单所列版本不低于目标位置已安装的 ``anet``\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:66
msgid ""
"The SHA-256 digest of the downloaded archive, and of the binary inside "
"it, equals the digest in the manifest."
msgstr "所下载归档及其中二进制文件的 SHA-256 摘要，与清单中的摘要一致。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:68
msgid ""
"The new binary reports the version and the module set that the manifest "
"names for its variant. The default variant must not contain the ``shell``"
" module."
msgstr "新二进制文件报告的版本和模块集合，与清单中为其变体所列的一致。默认变体不得包含 ``shell`` 模块。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:72
msgid ""
"The manifest and its signature are stored next to the binary, so that "
"``anet doctor`` can repeat the check later."
msgstr "清单及其签名存放于二进制文件旁，以便 ``anet doctor`` 日后重复该检查。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:75
msgid ""
"When the script finishes it runs ``anet init``, which writes the safe "
"default configuration (see :ref:`intro-install-init`), and prints the "
"result of ``anet doctor``."
msgstr ""
"脚本结束时会运行 ``anet init`` 以写入安全的默认配置（参见 :ref:`intro-install-init`），并输出 "
"``anet doctor`` 的结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:82
msgid "Installer options"
msgstr "安装程序选项"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:84
msgid "Options follow ``sh -s --`` when the script is read from a pipe."
msgstr "从管道读取脚本时，选项跟在 ``sh -s --`` 之后。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:90
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:91
#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:562
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:92
msgid "``--user``"
msgstr "``--user``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:93
msgid "Install to ``~/.local/bin``. This is the default."
msgstr "安装到 ``~/.local/bin``，为默认值。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:94
msgid "``--system``"
msgstr "``--system``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:95
msgid ""
"Install to ``/usr/local/bin``. ``sudo -n`` is used when required; the "
"installer never asks for a password. When ``sudo`` needs one, the "
"installer stops and says so; run ``sudo -v`` in the same terminal and "
"repeat the command."
msgstr ""
"安装到 ``/usr/local/bin``。需要时使用 ``sudo -n``；安装脚本从不询问密码。``sudo`` "
"需要密码时，安装脚本停止并说明原因；请在同一终端运行 ``sudo -v``，然后重新执行该命令。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:99
msgid "``--prefix DIR``"
msgstr "``--prefix DIR``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:100
msgid "Install to ``DIR``. Overrides ``--user`` and ``--system``."
msgstr "安装到 ``DIR``，优先于 ``--user`` 和 ``--system``\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:101
msgid "``--base URL``"
msgstr "``--base URL``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:102
msgid ""
"Download from ``URL`` instead of the default hosts (see :ref:`intro-"
"install-hosts`). Only ``https://`` is accepted. The environment variable "
"``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` names a host that is tried before the default "
"hosts. Every host is checked in the same way."
msgstr ""
"从 ``URL`` 下载，而不使用默认主机（见 :ref:`intro-install-hosts`\\ ）。仅接受 ``https://``\\"
" 。环境变量 ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 指定一个在默认主机之前尝试的主机。所有主机均以相同方式校验。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:106
msgid "``--shell``"
msgstr "``--shell``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:107
msgid ""
"Install the variant that can run operator-approved commands. This is a "
"different binary, not a setting; see :ref:`intro-install-modules`."
msgstr "安装可运行经运维者批准的命令的变体。这是另一个二进制文件，而不是一项设置，参见 :ref:`intro-install-modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:109
msgid "``--agents[=LIST]``"
msgstr "``--agents[=LIST]``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:110
msgid ""
"After installation, run ``anet agents wire`` for the coding agents found "
"on the machine, or only for the comma-separated ``LIST`` (``claude``, "
"``codex``, ``cursor``, ``opencode``, ``hermes``, ``workbuddy``)."
msgstr ""
"安装完成后，对本机上发现的编程 Agent 运行 ``anet agents wire``，或仅对以逗号分隔的 ``LIST`` "
"运行（``claude``\\ 、\\ ``codex``\\ 、\\ ``cursor``\\ 、\\ ``opencode``\\ 、\\ "
"``hermes``\\ 、\\ ``workbuddy``）。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:113
msgid "``--hub URL``"
msgstr "``--hub URL``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:114
#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:571
msgid "Start the node and register it with the hub at ``URL`` as the last step."
msgstr "最后一步启动节点，并将其注册到位于 ``URL`` 的 Hub。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:116
msgid "``--name NAME``"
msgstr "``--name NAME``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:117
msgid "The name to register under. The default is the host name."
msgstr "注册所用的名称，默认为主机名。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:118
msgid "``--without MODULES``"
msgstr "``--without MODULES``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:119
msgid ""
"Switch off the listed modules in the configuration. See :ref:`intro-"
"install-modules`."
msgstr "在配置中关闭所列模块。参见 :ref:`intro-install-modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:121
msgid "``--no-modify-path``"
msgstr "``--no-modify-path``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:122
msgid ""
"Do not change the shell profiles. The installer prints the line to add "
"instead (see :ref:`intro-install-path`)."
msgstr "不修改 shell 配置文件，改为打印需要加入的那一行（参见 :ref:`intro-install-path`）。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:124
msgid "``--help``"
msgstr "``--help``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:125
msgid "Print the option summary."
msgstr "输出选项摘要。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:127
msgid ""
"The options ``--hub`` and ``--name`` may be combined with ``--agents`` to"
" install, register and connect the local coding agents in one command:"
msgstr "选项 ``--hub`` 和 ``--name`` 可与 ``--agents`` 组合，以一条命令完成安装、注册并连接本地编程 Agent："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:135
msgid ""
"The registration output is printed as the last lines. On a hub that "
"admits by AID, the last line is the ``anet-hub admit`` command that the "
"hub operator runs; registration then completes without further input. See"
" :doc:`tutorial` for the full sequence."
msgstr ""
"注册输出位于最后几行。在按 AID 准入的 Hub 上，最后一行是 Hub 运维者需要运行的 ``anet-hub admit`` "
"命令，此后注册无需进一步输入即可完成。完整流程参见 :doc:`tutorial`\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:140
msgid ""
"Hubs no longer use invitation codes. The installer rejects the former "
"options ``--token`` and ``--token-file`` and says so."
msgstr "Hub 不再使用邀请码。安装程序会拒绝原有的 ``--token`` 与 ``--token-file`` 选项，并予以说明。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:146
msgid "Download hosts"
msgstr "下载主机"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:148
msgid ""
"Without ``--base``, the installer tries these hosts in order and uses the"
" first one that serves a release manifest and its signature:"
msgstr "不指定 ``--base`` 时，安装程序按以下顺序尝试各主机，并使用第一个提供发布清单及其签名的主机："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:151
msgid "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn``"
msgstr "``https://agentnetwork.org.cn``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:152
msgid "``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``"
msgstr "``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:153
msgid ""
"The npm package of the build, ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` "
"(``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-<os>-<cpu>`` with ``--shell``), through the "
"content delivery networks npmmirror "
"(``https://registry.npmmirror.com/<package>/latest/files``), jsDelivr "
"(``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/<package>@latest``) and unpkg "
"(``https://unpkg.com/<package>@latest``). ``<cpu>`` is ``x64`` or "
"``arm64``."
msgstr ""
"该构建的 npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>``\\ （使用 ``--shell`` 时为 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-<os>-<cpu>``\\ ），经由内容分发网络 npmmirror（\\ "
"``https://registry.npmmirror.com/<package>/latest/files``\\ ）、jsDelivr（\\"
" ``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/<package>@latest``\\ ）和 unpkg（\\ "
"``https://unpkg.com/<package>@latest``\\ ）获取。\\ ``<cpu>`` 为 ``x64`` 或 "
"``arm64``\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:161
msgid ""
"The directory ``dl/`` of each npm package holds ``release.json``, its "
"signature and the archive of the build exactly as the project hosts serve"
" them under ``/dl/``. Which host answers does not change what is "
"accepted: the checks above apply to every host, and a manifest that a "
"host serves and that fails a check ends the installation instead of "
"moving on to the next host. A content delivery network can serve an older"
" release for a while after a new one is published; the installer then "
"installs that release, or refuses it when a newer ``anet`` is already "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"每个 npm 包的 ``dl/`` 目录保存 ``release.json``\\ 、其签名和该构建的归档，与项目主机在 ``/dl/`` "
"下提供的文件完全相同。由哪个主机响应不影响接受的内容：上述检查适用于所有主机；某个主机提供的清单若未通过检查，安装即告结束，而不会转向下一个主机。新版本发布后，内容分发网络可能在一段时间内仍提供旧版本；此时安装程序安装该版本，若已安装更新的"
" ``anet`` 则拒绝安装。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:173
#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:481
msgid "Earlier installations"
msgstr "较早的安装"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:175
msgid ""
"The installer replaces earlier releases without asking for input. It "
"examines every ``anet`` on the search path, the ``anet`` in the global "
"``bin`` directory of npm, and ``/usr/local/bin/anet``, "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin/anet`` and ``~/.local/bin/anet``, and acts on each "
"one as follows."
msgstr ""
"安装脚本替换早期版本，不要求任何输入。它检查搜索路径中的每一个 ``anet``、npm 全局 ``bin`` 目录中的 ``anet``，以及 "
"``/usr/local/bin/anet``、``/opt/homebrew/bin/anet`` 和 "
"``~/.local/bin/anet``，并按下表处理。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:184
msgid "Found"
msgstr "检查结果"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:185
msgid "Action"
msgstr "处理方式"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:186
msgid ""
"AgentNetwork 1.x installed with npm (the package ``@agentnetwork/anet`` "
"1.x)"
msgstr "通过 npm 安装的 AgentNetwork 1.x（npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.x）"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:188
msgid ""
"The daemon is stopped with the ``anet stop`` command of that release. The"
" package is removed with ``npm uninstall -g @agentnetwork/anet`` under "
"the npm prefix in which it is installed."
msgstr ""
"用该版本自身的 ``anet stop`` 命令停止守护进程，并在其所在的 npm 前缀下用 ``npm uninstall -g "
"@agentnetwork/anet`` 删除该包。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:191
msgid ""
"AgentNetwork 1.x, anet 0.1 or anet 0.2 as a binary, for example from "
"``https://clawnet.cc/install.sh`` or from an earlier ``install.sh``"
msgstr ""
"以二进制文件形式安装的 AgentNetwork 1.x、anet 0.1 或 anet 0.2，例如来自 "
"``https://clawnet.cc/install.sh`` 或早期的 ``install.sh``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:193
msgid ""
"The daemon is stopped with ``anet stop`` (1.x) or ``anet stop --all`` "
"(0.1 and 0.2). In a directory that the user can write, the binary is "
"replaced by a symbolic link to the new binary, so that scripts and "
"configurations that name the old path run the new release. In a directory"
" that only the superuser can write, the binary is removed."
msgstr ""
"用 ``anet stop``\\ （1.x）或 ``anet stop --all``\\ （0.1 和 "
"0.2）停止守护进程。在用户可写的目录中，该二进制文件被替换为指向新二进制文件的符号链接，使引用旧路径的脚本和配置运行新版本。在只有超级用户可写的目录中，该二进制文件被删除。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:198
msgid "``anet`` 0.3 or later, and the npm launcher of 0.3 or later"
msgstr "``anet`` 0.3 或更高版本，以及 0.3 或更高版本的 npm 启动器"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:199
msgid ""
"Left in place and named in the report. The installation directory is "
"placed before it on the search path. An npm launcher whose command is the"
" installation target itself is removed with npm."
msgstr "保留原处，并在报告中列出。安装目录在搜索路径中被放在它之前。若 npm 启动器的命令恰好就是安装目标本身，则用 npm 将其删除。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:202
msgid "A file named ``anet`` that is not a program of AgentNetwork"
msgstr "名为 ``anet`` 但不是 AgentNetwork 程序的文件"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:203
msgid "Not run, not changed, and named in the report."
msgstr "不运行、不修改，并在报告中列出。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:205
msgid ""
"An earlier release is recognized by the Go module path in its binary, or "
"by the ``repository`` field of its npm package. Its version is read with "
"``anet version`` in an empty home directory and with a time limit. Apart "
"from that, only its ``stop`` command is run."
msgstr ""
"早期版本依据其二进制文件中的 Go 模块路径，或其 npm 包的 ``repository`` 字段识别。其版本号通过 ``anet "
"version`` 读取，运行时使用空的主目录并设有时限。除此之外，只运行其 ``stop`` 命令。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:210
msgid ""
"The data directory of an earlier release is renamed and never deleted. "
"The directory concerned is the one that the new release uses: "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``, else ``ANET_HOME``, else ``~/.anet``."
msgstr ""
"早期版本的数据目录只会被改名，绝不删除。所涉及的目录是新版本使用的目录：``ANET_DATA_DIR``，否则为 "
"``ANET_HOME``，否则为 ``~/.anet``。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:214
msgid ""
"A directory with the identity file of anet 0.1 or 0.2, or with the files "
"of AgentNetwork 1.x and no identity of 0.3, is renamed to "
"``<directory>-legacy-<version>-<time>``, for example ``~/.anet-"
"legacy-1.1.15-20261020T120000Z``. The time is UTC. The files that ``anet "
"init`` of 0.3 may have written into it hold no identity and move with it."
" ``anet init`` then writes a new configuration, and the first ``anet up``"
" creates a new identity."
msgstr ""
"含有 anet 0.1 或 0.2 身份文件的目录，或含有 AgentNetwork 1.x 文件而没有 0.3 身份的目录，被改名为 "
"``<目录>-legacy-<版本>-<时间>``，例如 ``~/.anet-"
"legacy-1.1.15-20261020T120000Z``，时间为 UTC。0.3 的 ``anet init`` "
"可能已写入其中的文件不含身份，随目录一起移走。随后 ``anet init`` 写入新的配置，第一次 ``anet up`` 创建新的身份。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:221
msgid ""
"A directory with the files of AgentNetwork 1.x and an identity of 0.3 "
"(``identity.kel``, or ``ids/<name>/identity.kel``) stays in place. Only "
"the 1.x files are moved into the new directory."
msgstr ""
"同时含有 AgentNetwork 1.x 文件和 0.3 身份（``identity.kel`` 或 "
"``ids/<name>/identity.kel``）的目录保留原处，只有 1.x 的文件被移入新目录。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:224
msgid "A directory of 0.3, or of a newer release, is not changed."
msgstr "0.3 或更新版本的目录不作任何修改。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:226
msgid ""
"The daemon applies the same rule. It does not start in a data directory "
"of an earlier release and reports ``identity_v02``. The directory is not "
"moved while a daemon of the earlier release may still use it, that is, "
"while the process named in its ``daemon.pid`` runs or while its control "
"address answers. The report then gives the command to run after that "
"daemon has stopped, and ``anet init`` is skipped."
msgstr ""
"守护进程采用同一规则：它不在早期版本的数据目录中启动，并报告 ``identity_v02``。早期版本的守护进程可能仍在使用该目录时，即 "
"``daemon.pid`` 中记录的进程仍在运行，或其控制地址仍有应答时，目录不会被移动。此时报告给出该守护进程停止后需要运行的命令，并跳过 "
"``anet init``。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:233
msgid ""
"``sudo`` is used only as ``sudo -n``, which fails instead of asking for a"
" password. A step that needs a password is not carried out; the report "
"gives the exact command. At the end of the output, the section ``Upgraded"
" from anet <version>`` lists what was stopped, removed, replaced and "
"moved, and the commands that remain:"
msgstr ""
"``sudo`` 只以 ``sudo -n`` 的形式使用，需要密码时直接失败而不询问。需要密码的步骤不会执行，报告给出确切的命令。输出末尾的 "
"``Upgraded from anet <version>`` 一节列出已停止、删除、替换和移走的内容，以及尚需运行的命令："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:252
msgid ""
"The renamed directory keeps the identity and the API tokens of the "
"earlier release. Release 0.3 does not read them. See :doc:`/upgrading` "
"for the steps after the installation."
msgstr "改名后的目录保存早期版本的身份和 API 令牌，0.3 版不读取它们。安装后的步骤参见 :doc:`/upgrading`。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:259
msgid "Search path"
msgstr "搜索路径"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:261
msgid ""
"A new terminal runs the new ``anet`` without further steps. When the "
"installation directory is not on the search path, when another ``anet`` "
"comes before it, or when a new login shell does not find the new binary, "
"the installer appends this block to the shell profiles, or replaces the "
"block if it is already present:"
msgstr ""
"新打开的终端无需其他步骤即运行新的 ``anet``。安装目录不在搜索路径中、搜索路径中另有 ``anet`` 位于其前，或新的登录 shell "
"找不到新的二进制文件时，安装脚本将下面这段内容追加到 shell 配置文件中；该段已存在时则替换它："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:279
msgid "Shell"
msgstr "Shell"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:280
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "配置文件"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:281
msgid "zsh"
msgstr "zsh"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:282
msgid ""
"``.zprofile`` and ``.zshrc`` in ``$ZDOTDIR``, or in the home directory "
"when ``ZDOTDIR`` is not set"
msgstr "``$ZDOTDIR`` 中的 ``.zprofile`` 和 ``.zshrc``；未设置 ``ZDOTDIR`` 时为主目录中的这两个文件"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:284
msgid "bash"
msgstr "bash"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:285
msgid ""
"``~/.bash_profile`` if it exists, else ``~/.bash_login`` if it exists, "
"else ``~/.profile``; and ``~/.bashrc``"
msgstr ""
"``~/.bash_profile``\\ （若存在），否则 ``~/.bash_login``\\ （若存在），否则 "
"``~/.profile``；以及 ``~/.bashrc``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:287
msgid "fish"
msgstr "fish"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:288
msgid ""
"``~/.config/fish/conf.d/anet.fish`` (below ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` when it is"
" set), with the same effect in fish syntax"
msgstr ""
"``~/.config/fish/conf.d/anet.fish``\\ （设置了 ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` 时位于其下），以 "
"fish 语法实现相同效果"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:290
msgid "Other shells"
msgstr "其他 shell"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:291
msgid "``~/.profile``"
msgstr "``~/.profile``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:293
msgid ""
"The profiles of the login shell named by ``SHELL`` are created when they "
"do not exist. The profiles of other shells are changed only when they "
"exist. Running the installer again adds no second block; a block that is "
"no longer last in its file is moved to the end. A profile that is a "
"symbolic link, for example into a repository of dotfiles, is written "
"through the link. A file with a block whose end marker is missing is not "
"changed and is named in the report."
msgstr ""
"``SHELL`` 所指登录 shell 的配置文件不存在时会被创建；其他 shell "
"的配置文件只在已存在时修改。再次运行安装脚本不会加入第二段；已不在文件末尾的该段会被移到末尾。作为符号链接的配置文件（例如指向 dotfiles "
"仓库）通过链接写入。某段缺少结束标记的文件不作修改，并在报告中列出。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:301
msgid ""
"The installer then starts a login, interactive shell of ``SHELL`` with an"
" empty environment and input from ``/dev/null``, asks it for ``command -v"
" anet``, and reports the result on one line:"
msgstr ""
"随后，安装脚本以空环境、从 ``/dev/null`` 读取输入的方式启动 ``SHELL`` 的登录交互式 shell，执行 ``command"
" -v anet``，并用一行报告结果："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:309
msgid ""
"The terminal in which the installer runs keeps its search path. The "
"installer prints the command that updates it:"
msgstr "运行安装脚本的终端保留原有的搜索路径。安装脚本打印更新它的命令："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:316
msgid ""
"With ``--no-modify-path``, the profiles are not changed and the installer"
" prints the line to add. When the installer runs as the superuser, it "
"does not change profiles. To undo the change, delete the lines between "
"the two markers."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--no-modify-path`` "
"时，配置文件不作修改，安装脚本打印需要加入的那一行。以超级用户身份运行时，安装脚本不修改配置文件。要撤销修改，删除两个标记之间的各行即可。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:323
#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:512
msgid "Verifying the installer before running it"
msgstr "运行前验证安装程序"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:325
msgid ""
"``curl ... | sh`` trusts the host that serves the script and that host's "
"TLS certificate. The signature checks above protect the binary, not the "
"script itself. To avoid trusting the host, download the script and its "
"signature, and verify both with the published release key before running "
"the script."
msgstr ""
"``curl ... | sh`` 信任提供该脚本的主机及其 TLS "
"证书。上述签名检查保护的是二进制文件，而不是脚本本身。若不愿信任该主机，请下载脚本及其签名，并在运行脚本之前用公布的发布密钥验证二者。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:331
msgid ""
"The release key belongs to the project maintainers. It signs binaries, "
"the installer and the manifest of release artifacts. It is not an "
"identity key of any node. The key and its fingerprint are also published "
"in ``SECURITY.md`` and ``README.md`` of the ANet repository; compare them"
" with the values below, and use the repository copy if they differ."
msgstr ""
"发布密钥属于项目维护者，用于签署二进制文件、安装程序和发布产物的清单，不是任何节点的身份密钥。密钥及其指纹也公布于 ANet 仓库的 "
"``SECURITY.md`` 和 ``README.md`` 中；请与下列值比对，二者不一致时以仓库中的副本为准。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:344
msgid ""
"The key fingerprint is "
"``SHA256:/4FMm/jgZcBII3z3O3r81Y8SxFfugdLRu3zj2gnclD4``. A successful "
"check prints ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" signature`` "
"followed by the fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"密钥指纹为 ``SHA256:/4FMm/jgZcBII3z3O3r81Y8SxFfugdLRu3zj2gnclD4``\\ 。检查成功时会输出 "
"``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" signature``，后接指纹。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:351
msgid "Installing on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上安装"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:353
msgid ""
"The Windows build runs natively on Windows 10 version 1809 or later and "
"on Windows Server 2019 or later, on amd64 and arm64. WSL2 is not "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Windows 版本在 Windows 10 1809 或更高版本以及 Windows Server 2019 或更高版本上原生运行，支持 "
"amd64 与 arm64，无需 WSL2。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:359
msgid ""
"Windows PowerShell 5.1, which every supported version of Windows "
"includes. The installer uses no tool that has to be installed; in "
"particular it does not use ``ssh-keygen``, because Windows 10 version "
"1809 ships an OpenSSH release older than 8.1."
msgstr ""
"Windows PowerShell 5.1，所有受支持的 Windows 版本均自带该组件。安装程序不使用任何需要另行安装的工具，尤其不使用 "
"``ssh-keygen``，因为 Windows 10 1809 自带的 OpenSSH 版本低于 8.1。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:363
msgid "Outbound HTTPS to the download hosts."
msgstr "可向下载主机发起出站 HTTPS 连接。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:365
msgid ""
"The installer runs in a window that is elevated or not, and in a session "
"without a visible console, such as the tool call of an agent or a CI job."
msgstr "安装程序可在提升权限或未提升权限的窗口中运行，也可在没有可见控制台的会话中运行，例如代理的工具调用或 CI 作业。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:369
msgid "Installing with the one-line command"
msgstr "使用单行命令安装"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:371
msgid ""
"The installation is started with one line. The line is identical in "
"``cmd.exe``, Windows PowerShell 5.1, PowerShell 7, a ``bash`` or ``zsh`` "
"shell in WSL 1 or WSL 2, and Git Bash: it contains no character that one "
"of these shells interprets, and everything after ``-Command`` is one "
"argument in double quotes. Replace ``CONTROLLER_AID`` with the AID of the"
" node that is to be given access to the shell module of this computer:"
msgstr ""
"安装只需一行命令。该命令在 ``cmd.exe``、Windows PowerShell 5.1、PowerShell 7、WSL 1 或 WSL"
" 2 中的 ``bash`` 或 ``zsh`` 以及 Git Bash 中完全相同：其中不含上述任何 shell "
"会解释的字符，``-Command`` 之后的全部内容是一个用双引号括起的参数。请将 ``CONTROLLER_AID`` 替换为将获得本机 "
"shell 模块访问权限的节点的 AID："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:382
msgid ""
"Without ``-Controller``, the line installs the default build only and "
"changes nothing else:"
msgstr "不指定 ``-Controller`` 时，该命令仅安装默认版本，不更改其他任何内容："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:389
msgid ""
"The line starts a new ``powershell.exe``, which enables TLS 1.2 (required"
" by Windows PowerShell 5.1), downloads ``install.ps1`` and runs it as a "
"script block, to which the execution policy does not apply. The "
"placeholder is a plain word because ``cmd.exe`` reads ``<`` and ``>`` as "
"redirections; the installer refuses the unchanged placeholder "
"``CONTROLLER_AID`` with a message that names it. The exit status of "
"``powershell.exe`` is the result of the installation: 0 when it "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"该命令启动一个新的 ``powershell.exe``，后者启用 TLS 1.2（Windows PowerShell 5.1 需要），下载 "
"``install.ps1`` 并将其作为脚本块运行，执行策略不适用于脚本块。由于 ``cmd.exe`` 将 ``<`` 与 ``>`` "
"解释为重定向，占位符采用普通单词；安装程序拒绝未替换的占位符 "
"``CONTROLLER_AID``，并在消息中指明该占位符。``powershell.exe`` 的退出状态即为安装结果：安装完成时为 0。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:398
msgid "No interaction"
msgstr "无交互"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:400
msgid ""
"The installer asks no question and reads nothing from the console. Every "
"decision is made from the parameters on the command line. In particular:"
msgstr "安装程序不提出任何问题，也不从控制台读取任何内容。所有决定均依据命令行中的参数作出。具体而言："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:403
msgid ""
"``-Controller`` on the command line is the consent to the grant. The "
"installer passes it to ``anet init --shell-controller`` as ``--yes``, and"
" no confirmation is asked. At the end, the installer prints what was "
"granted, read back from ``config.json`` and ``peers.allow``, and the two "
"steps that revoke it."
msgstr ""
"命令行中的 ``-Controller`` 即为对授权的同意。安装程序将其以 ``--yes`` 传给 ``anet init --shell-"
"controller``，不请求任何确认。安装结束时，安装程序列出从 ``config.json`` 与 ``peers.allow`` "
"读回的已授予权限，以及撤销权限的两个步骤。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:408
msgid ""
"The recovery passphrase is not asked during the installation (``anet hub-"
"register --passphrase-later``); set it afterwards with ``anet identity "
"protect``."
msgstr ""
"安装过程中不询问恢复口令（``anet hub-register --passphrase-later``）；请在安装后使用 ``anet "
"identity protect`` 设置。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:411
msgid ""
"The installation also completes when standard input and output are not a "
"console, as with WSL interoperability, a CI job or the tool call of an "
"agent."
msgstr "标准输入与标准输出不是控制台时（例如 WSL 互操作、CI 作业或代理的工具调用），安装同样可以完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:416
msgid "Running the command in WSL"
msgstr "在 WSL 中运行该命令"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:418
msgid ""
"Run in a WSL shell, the line installs the Windows build on the Windows "
"host, for the Windows user who runs WSL: that is the computer that the "
"controller is given, and the node runs as a Windows program. The command "
"requires that ``powershell.exe`` can be started from WSL, which WSL "
"interoperability provides and which is enabled by default (``[interop] "
"enabled`` and ``appendWindowsPath`` in ``/etc/wsl.conf``). To install "
"ANet inside the Linux distribution instead, use ``install.sh`` (see :ref"
":`intro-install-script`)."
msgstr ""
"在 WSL 的 shell 中运行时，该命令以运行 WSL 的 Windows 用户身份，在 Windows 主机上安装 Windows "
"版本：控制方获得的正是这台计算机，节点作为 Windows 程序运行。该命令要求能够从 WSL 启动 "
"``powershell.exe``，这由默认启用的 WSL 互操作提供（``/etc/wsl.conf`` 中的 ``[interop] "
"enabled`` 与 ``appendWindowsPath``）。如需在 Linux 发行版内部安装 ANet，请使用 "
"``install.sh``\\ （参见 :ref:`intro-install-script`）。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:427
msgid "The install directory"
msgstr "安装目录"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:429
msgid ""
"Without ``-Prefix``, the installer chooses the install directory. It uses"
" the first of the following directories that passes the checks below, and"
" prints one line for each directory it skips, with the reason; the reason"
" names the accounts concerned, and an account that Windows cannot name is"
" shown by its SID followed by ``(unresolved)``:"
msgstr ""
"未指定 ``-Prefix`` "
"时，由安装程序选择安装目录。它使用下列目录中第一个通过下述检查的目录，并为每个跳过的目录输出一行原因；原因中写明相关账户的名称，Windows "
"无法解析名称的账户以其 SID 加 ``(unresolved)`` 表示："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:435
msgid ""
"the directory of an ANet 0.3 or later that is already installed for the "
"user, found on the user's ``PATH`` or in the ``Run`` value below;"
msgstr "已为该用户安装的 ANet 0.3 或更高版本所在的目录，依据用户的 ``PATH`` 或下文的 ``Run`` 值查找；"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:437
msgid "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``;"
msgstr "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``；"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:438
msgid ""
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin``, beside the runtime directory "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run`` of the node;"
msgstr "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin``，与节点的运行时目录 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run`` 相邻；"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:440
msgid "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``."
msgstr "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:442
msgid ""
"A directory passes when no directory above it grants another account the "
"right to rename it or to change its access control list, and when it is "
"private to the user: it is owned by the user, SYSTEM or Administrators, "
"and no access control entry grants another account more than "
"synchronization, traversal and reading attributes. Such entries, for "
"example the one that Windows grants an app container capability on the "
"profile directory, give no access to the contents and are ignored. An "
"entry that grants listing or reading, writing or appending, creating "
"files or subdirectories, deletion, reading or changing permissions, "
"taking ownership, or a generic right fails the check. A directory that "
"does not exist yet is checked through the nearest directory above it, and"
" each missing level is created with an access control list of its own: "
"full control for the user, SYSTEM and Administrators, and nothing else. "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet`` is created in this way when the third directory "
"is used, and the node accepts it as the parent of its runtime directory."
msgstr ""
"目录须满足以下条件方可通过检查：其上层的任何目录均未向其他账户授予重命名该目录或更改其访问控制列表的权限；该目录为当前用户私有，即其所有者为当前用户、SYSTEM"
" 或 Administrators，且没有任何访问控制项向其他账户授予超出同步、遍历与读取属性的权限。此类访问控制项（例如 Windows "
"在用户配置文件目录上授予应用容器功能的访问控制项）不提供对内容的任何访问，因此被忽略。授予列出或读取、写入或追加、创建文件或子目录、删除、读取或更改权限、取得所有权或通用权限的访问控制项不能通过检查。尚不存在的目录依据其最近的已存在上级目录检查，缺失的每一级目录在创建时设置其自己的访问控制列表：当前用户、SYSTEM"
" 与 Administrators 拥有完全控制权限，此外没有任何其他项。使用第三个目录时，``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet`` "
"即以这种方式创建，节点接受其作为运行时目录的上级目录。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:458
msgid ""
"``-Prefix`` overrides the choice. The given directory is subject to the "
"same checks, and a directory that fails them is refused."
msgstr "``-Prefix`` 覆盖上述选择。所指定的目录接受相同的检查，未通过检查的目录会被拒绝。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:462
msgid "An elevated window"
msgstr "提升权限的窗口"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:464
msgid ""
"An elevated window is not refused. ANet is installed for the current "
"account, with the same per-user directories, ``PATH`` and ``Run`` value "
"as in a window that is not elevated. The parameter ``-Elevated`` is "
"accepted for compatibility and has no effect."
msgstr ""
"安装程序不拒绝提升权限的窗口。ANet 为当前账户安装，所用的按用户目录、``PATH`` 与 ``Run`` "
"值与未提升权限的窗口相同。为保持兼容，参数 ``-Elevated`` 仍被接受，但不产生任何作用。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:469
msgid ""
"The node is not started with the elevated token when a standard user "
"token is available. The installer registers a one-time task in the Task "
"Scheduler for the current user, with the interactive token and the least "
"privileges, runs ``anet up`` through it and deletes the task. When "
"Windows has no standard user token for the account, because User Account "
"Control is off or the account is the built-in Administrator, or when the "
"task cannot run, for example because the user is not logged on "
"interactively, the node is started directly with the rights of the "
"window, and the installer says so in one line. At the next logon, the "
"``Run`` value starts the node with the token of the logon."
msgstr ""
"存在标准用户令牌时，节点不以提升后的令牌启动。安装程序在任务计划程序中为当前用户注册一个一次性任务，该任务使用交互式令牌与最低权限，通过它运行 "
"``anet up``，随后删除该任务。若 Windows 未为该账户提供标准用户令牌（因为用户账户控制已关闭，或该账户为内置 "
"Administrator "
"账户），或该任务无法运行（例如用户未以交互方式登录），则节点直接以窗口的权限启动，安装程序以一行文字说明这一情况。下次登录时，``Run`` "
"值以该次登录的令牌启动节点。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:483
msgid ""
"The installer takes over from other ANet installations of the user, "
"without asking:"
msgstr "安装程序接管该用户的其他 ANet 安装，不进行询问："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:486
msgid ""
"An ANet of an earlier line (the npm package ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.x, "
"or 0.1 or 0.2) that is found on the machine's or the user's ``PATH`` or "
"in the global npm prefix (``npm prefix -g``) is stopped with its own "
"``stop`` command, with a time limit. The installer never ends a process "
"by name."
msgstr ""
"在计算机或用户的 ``PATH`` 中，或在全局 npm 前缀（``npm prefix -g``）中找到的较早版本系列的 ANet（npm 包 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.x，或 0.1、0.2），会在时间限制内以其自身的 ``stop`` "
"命令停止。安装程序从不按名称结束进程。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:490
msgid ""
"Its npm package is removed with ``npm uninstall -g @agentnetwork/anet``. "
"When that is not possible, the installer prints the command to run."
msgstr "其 npm 包通过 ``npm uninstall -g @agentnetwork/anet`` 卸载。无法卸载时，安装程序输出需要运行的命令。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:492
msgid ""
"Its data in ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` is moved aside, never deleted, after"
" its daemon has stopped. When no identity of ANet 0.3 or later is in the "
"directory, the whole directory is renamed to ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-"
"legacy-<version>-<UTC time>``. Otherwise only the entries of the earlier "
"line (``api_token``, ``anet``, ``orgs`` and ``state``) are moved into a "
"directory of that name, and the data of 0.3 stays in place. A data "
"directory of 0.3 or later is never moved."
msgstr ""
"其守护进程停止后，其位于 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` 的数据被移至别处，从不删除。若该目录中没有 ANet 0.3 "
"或更高版本的身份，则整个目录被重命名为 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-legacy-<版本>-<UTC "
"时间>``。否则仅将较早版本系列的条目（``api_token``、``anet``、``orgs`` 与 "
"``state``）移入以该名称命名的目录，0.3 的数据保留原处。0.3 或更高版本的数据目录从不移动。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:499
msgid ""
"Another installation of ANet 0.3 or later outside npm is left in place "
"and taken off the user's ``PATH``, so that the ``PATH`` holds one copy. "
"The npm launcher of 0.3 or later is left alone."
msgstr ""
"npm 之外的其他 ANet 0.3 或更高版本安装保留原处，并从用户的 ``PATH`` 中移除，使 ``PATH`` 中只有一份副本。0.3 "
"或更高版本的 npm 启动器不受影响。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:503
msgid ""
"The install directory is put first on the user's ``PATH``. The installer "
"then starts a new ``powershell.exe`` with the ``PATH`` that a new window "
"receives and reports in one line which ``anet`` it runs. A directory on "
"the machine's ``PATH`` precedes the user's ``PATH``; an earlier ``anet`` "
"there is reported. Finally, the installer lists what it stopped, removed "
"and moved."
msgstr ""
"安装目录置于用户 ``PATH`` 的首位。随后，安装程序以新窗口所得的 ``PATH`` 启动一个新的 "
"``powershell.exe``，并以一行文字报告其运行的是哪个 ``anet``。计算机 ``PATH`` 中的目录位于用户 "
"``PATH`` 之前；其中若有较早的 ``anet``，则予以报告。最后，安装程序列出已停止、已卸载与已移动的内容。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:514
msgid ""
"The one-line command trusts the host that serves ``install.ps1`` and its "
"TLS certificate. To avoid that trust, download the script and its "
"signature, verify the signature with the release key, and run the "
"verified copy."
msgstr ""
"单行命令信任提供 ``install.ps1`` 的主机及其 TLS "
"证书。若不愿信任该主机，请下载脚本及其签名，用发布密钥验证签名，然后运行已验证的副本。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:518
msgid ""
"The signature is checked with ``ssh-keygen -Y verify`` from OpenSSH 8.1 "
"or later (``ssh -V`` prints the version). The following block, for a "
"PowerShell window, writes the file ``allowed_signers`` with the release "
"key line given in :ref:`intro-install-verify` as UTF-8 without a byte "
"order mark, which ``ssh-keygen`` requires; the ``>`` redirection of "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1 writes UTF-16. It runs the check in ``cmd.exe``, "
"which provides the input redirection that PowerShell lacks, and stops "
"before running the script when the signature does not verify:"
msgstr ""
"签名使用 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本的 ``ssh-keygen -Y verify`` 检查（``ssh -V`` "
"输出版本号）。以下代码块用于 PowerShell 窗口，它以不带字节顺序标记的 UTF-8 写入文件 "
"``allowed_signers``，内容为 :ref:`intro-install-verify` 中给出的发布密钥行，这是 ``ssh-"
"keygen`` 的要求；Windows PowerShell 5.1 的 ``>`` 重定向写出 UTF-16。代码块在提供输入重定向的 "
"``cmd.exe`` 中执行检查（PowerShell 不支持输入重定向），签名验证未通过时在运行脚本之前停止："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:534
msgid ""
"When this computer has an older OpenSSH, copy ``install.ps1``, "
"``install.ps1.sig`` and ``allowed_signers`` to a computer with OpenSSH "
"8.1 or later and run the check there. The command is the same in "
"``cmd.exe`` and in a POSIX shell:"
msgstr ""
"本机的 OpenSSH 版本低于 8.1 时，请将 ``install.ps1``\\ 、\\ ``install.ps1.sig`` 与 "
"``allowed_signers`` 复制到装有 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本的计算机上执行检查。该命令在 ``cmd.exe`` 与 "
"POSIX shell 中相同："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:543
msgid ""
"A successful check prints ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" "
"signature`` followed by the key fingerprint. Only then run the verified "
"copy in PowerShell, in the directory that holds it:"
msgstr ""
"检查成功时会输出 ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" "
"signature``，后接密钥指纹。仅在此之后，才在 PowerShell 中，于保存该副本的目录内运行已验证的副本："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:551
msgid ""
"Run in an open PowerShell window in this way, the script leaves the "
"window open and sets ``$LASTEXITCODE`` to the result."
msgstr "以这种方式在已打开的 PowerShell 窗口中运行时，脚本不会关闭该窗口，并将 ``$LASTEXITCODE`` 设为安装结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:555
msgid "Installer parameters"
msgstr "安装程序参数"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:561
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:563
msgid "``-Controller <AID>``"
msgstr "``-Controller <AID>``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:564
msgid ""
"Install the build with the ``shell`` module, give exactly this AID access"
" to it (see :ref:`intro-install-windows-controller`), and join "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` unless ``-Hub`` or ``-NoJoin`` is "
"given. The parameter is the consent to the grant."
msgstr ""
"安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本，仅授予该 AID 访问权限（参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-"
"controller`），并加入 ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``，除非指定了 ``-Hub`` 或 "
"``-NoJoin``。该参数即为对授权的同意。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:568
msgid "``-Shell``"
msgstr "``-Shell``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:569
msgid "Install the build with the ``shell`` module. No caller is given access."
msgstr "安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本。不向任何调用方授予访问权限。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:570
msgid "``-Hub <URL>``"
msgstr "``-Hub <URL>``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:573
msgid "``-NoJoin``"
msgstr "``-NoJoin``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:574
msgid ""
"Do not register with a hub. With ``-Controller``, the node is still "
"started. Register later with ``anet hub-register``."
msgstr "不注册到 hub。与 ``-Controller`` 一起使用时，节点仍会启动。之后可使用 ``anet hub-register`` 注册。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:576
msgid "``-Name <name>``"
msgstr "``-Name <name>``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:577
msgid "The name to register under. The default is the computer name."
msgstr "注册所用的名称，默认为计算机名。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:578
msgid "``-Prefix <directory>``"
msgstr "``-Prefix <directory>``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:579
msgid ""
"Install to this absolute directory instead of the directory the installer"
" chooses. The directory must pass the checks of the chosen directories. A"
" directory name that contains ``;`` or ``%`` is refused."
msgstr "安装到该绝对路径目录，而不是安装程序选择的目录。该目录必须通过与自动选择的目录相同的检查。目录名中含有 ``;`` 或 ``%`` 时会被拒绝。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:582
msgid "``-Without <modules>``"
msgstr "``-Without <modules>``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:583
msgid ""
"Switch off the listed modules in the configuration, as ``install.sh "
"--without`` does (see :ref:`intro-install-modules`). The configuration is"
" changed after the binary is installed."
msgstr ""
"在配置中关闭所列模块，与 ``install.sh --without`` 相同（参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"modules`）。配置在二进制文件安装完成后才会修改。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:586
msgid "``-Base <URL or directory>``"
msgstr "``-Base <URL or directory>``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:587
msgid ""
"Download from this ``https://`` address, or read a release from this "
"local directory, instead of the default hosts. Every check is the same."
msgstr "从该 ``https://`` 地址下载，或从该本地目录读取发布版本，而不使用默认主机。所有检查均相同。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:589
msgid "``-NoAutostart``"
msgstr "``-NoAutostart``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:590
msgid "Do not write the value that starts the node at logon."
msgstr "不写入登录时启动节点的注册表值。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:591
msgid "``-NoPath``"
msgstr "``-NoPath``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:592
msgid "Do not put the installation directory on the user's ``PATH``."
msgstr "不将安装目录加入用户的 ``PATH``。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:593
msgid "``-Elevated``"
msgstr "``-Elevated``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:594
msgid "Accepted for compatibility with 0.3.4; it has no effect."
msgstr "为与 0.3.4 兼容而保留，不产生任何作用。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:596
msgid ""
"The download hosts are those of :ref:`intro-install-hosts`. The npm "
"packages of the Windows builds are ``@agentnetwork/anet-win32-<cpu>`` and"
" ``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-win32-<cpu>``."
msgstr ""
"下载主机与 :ref:`intro-install-hosts` 相同。Windows 版本的 npm 包为 ``@agentnetwork"
"/anet-win32-<cpu>`` 与 ``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-win32-<cpu>``\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:601
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:607
msgid "Item"
msgstr "项目"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:608
msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:609
msgid "Binary"
msgstr "二进制文件"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:610
msgid ""
"``anet.exe`` in the install directory (see above), with the release "
"manifest ``anet.exe.release.json`` and its signature "
"``anet.exe.release.json.sig`` beside it."
msgstr ""
"安装目录（见上文）中的 ``anet.exe``，其旁边存放发布清单 ``anet.exe.release.json`` 及其签名 "
"``anet.exe.release.json.sig``。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:613
msgid "Data directory"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:614
msgid "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``"
msgstr "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:615
msgid "Runtime directory"
msgstr "运行时目录"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:616
msgid "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run``"
msgstr "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:617
msgid "Start at logon"
msgstr "登录时启动"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:618
msgid ""
"The value ``AgentNetwork`` under "
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run``. Removing the"
" value stops the start at logon."
msgstr ""
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run`` 下的值 "
"``AgentNetwork``。删除该值即不再于登录时启动。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:623
msgid "What the installer checks"
msgstr "安装程序检查的内容"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:625
msgid ""
"``install.ps1`` is signed (``install.ps1.sig``) and carries the SHA-256 "
"digests of the Windows release binaries."
msgstr ""
"``install.ps1`` 已签名（\\ ``install.ps1.sig``），并载有 Windows 发布二进制文件的 SHA-256 "
"摘要。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:627
msgid ""
"Nothing that is downloaded is run or installed before it matches those "
"digests."
msgstr "下载的任何内容在与这些摘要一致之前，都不会被运行或安装。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:629
msgid ""
"The downloaded binary then verifies, with the release key built into it, "
"the signature of ``release.json``, its expiry, its version, the SHA-256 "
"digest of the binary itself and its module set, and it refuses a "
"downgrade."
msgstr ""
"随后，下载的二进制文件使用其内置的发布密钥，验证 ``release.json`` 的签名、有效期、版本、二进制文件自身的 SHA-256 "
"摘要及其模块集合，并拒绝降级。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:632
msgid "No option skips a check."
msgstr "没有任何选项可以跳过检查。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:637
msgid "What ``-Controller`` opens"
msgstr "``-Controller`` 开放的内容"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:639
msgid "``-Controller`` changes exactly the following, and nothing else:"
msgstr "``-Controller`` 仅更改以下各项，不更改其他任何内容："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:641
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The configuration block ``modules.shell = "
"{\"allow\":[\"<AID>\"],\"allow_arbitrary\":true,\"shell\":\"powershell\"}``."
msgstr ""
"配置块 ``modules.shell = "
"{\"allow\":[\"<AID>\"],\"allow_arbitrary\":true,\"shell\":\"powershell\"}``\\"
" 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:643
msgid "The AID on ``peers.allow``."
msgstr "``peers.allow`` 中的该 AID。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:644
msgid ""
"The defaults of ``anet init``: the inbound policy ``closed``, no public "
"capabilities and spending limits of 0 (see :ref:`intro-install-init`)."
msgstr ""
"``anet init`` 的默认值：入站策略 ``closed``\\ 、无公开能力、支付限额为 0（参见 :ref:`intro-"
"install-init`）。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:646
msgid "The registration with the hub, unless ``-NoJoin`` is given."
msgstr "向 Hub 的注册，指定 ``-NoJoin`` 时除外。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:648
msgid ""
"Up to version 0.3.4, the installer asked one confirmation on the console."
" That confirmation is removed: the parameter on the command line is the "
"consent, and the installer runs ``anet init --shell-controller <AID> "
"--yes``. Run without ``--yes`` in a terminal, ``anet init --shell-"
"controller`` still asks the confirmation. Access is revoked with ``anet "
"peers remove <AID>`` and by removing the ``modules.shell`` block from "
"``config.json``, followed by a restart of the node. The shell module on "
"Windows is described in :ref:`topics-shell-windows`."
msgstr ""
"0.3.4 及更早版本的安装程序会在控制台上请求一次确认。该确认已移除：命令行中的参数即为同意，安装程序运行 ``anet init "
"--shell-controller <AID> --yes``。在终端中不带 ``--yes`` 运行时，``anet init "
"--shell-controller`` 仍会请求确认。撤销访问权限的方法是运行 ``anet peers remove <AID>``，并从 "
"``config.json`` 中删除 ``modules.shell`` 块，然后重启节点。Windows 上的 shell 模块参见 :ref"
":`topics-shell-windows`。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:658
msgid "Background operation"
msgstr "后台运行"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:660
msgid ""
"``anet up`` starts the daemon detached from the console. The daemon keeps"
" running when the window is closed, stops at logoff, and starts again at "
"logon through the ``Run`` value above. It runs as the logged-on user and "
"never as a Windows service."
msgstr ""
"``anet up`` 以脱离控制台的方式启动守护进程。关闭窗口后守护进程继续运行，注销时停止，登录时通过上述 ``Run`` "
"值再次启动。它以已登录用户的身份运行，从不作为 Windows 服务运行。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:666
msgid "Updating on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上更新"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:668
msgid ""
"``anet update`` applies the checks described in :ref:`intro-install-"
"update`. A running ``anet.exe`` cannot be overwritten, so the update "
"renames it aside and puts the new binary in its place. The daemon keeps "
"the old binary until it is restarted. Windows PowerShell 5.1 has no "
"``&&`` operator; run the two commands one after the other:"
msgstr ""
"``anet update`` 执行 :ref:`intro-install-update` 所述的检查。运行中的 ``anet.exe`` "
"无法被覆盖，因此更新会将其重命名到一旁，再将新二进制文件放到原位置。守护进程在重启之前继续使用旧的二进制文件。Windows PowerShell"
" 5.1 没有 ``&&`` 运算符；请依次运行以下两条命令："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:679
msgid ""
"Running the one-line command again also updates an installation; it "
"reuses the install directory of the existing installation when that "
"directory passes the checks."
msgstr "再次运行这一行命令同样会更新安装；若现有安装的目录通过检查，则继续使用该目录。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:684
msgid "Uninstalling on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上卸载"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:686
msgid "Stop the daemons with ``anet stop --all``."
msgstr "用 ``anet stop --all`` 停止各守护进程。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:687
msgid ""
"Remove the value ``AgentNetwork`` under "
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run``."
msgstr ""
"删除 ``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run`` 下的值 "
"``AgentNetwork``。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:689
msgid ""
"Delete the install directory; ``(Get-Command anet).Source`` names the "
"binary in it."
msgstr "删除安装目录；``(Get-Command anet).Source`` 显示其中二进制文件的路径。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:691
msgid "Remove that directory from the user's ``PATH``."
msgstr "从用户的 ``PATH`` 中移除该目录。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:693
msgid ""
"The data directory ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` holds the identity. Delete it"
" only deliberately, as described in :ref:`intro-install-remove`."
msgstr ""
"数据目录 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` 保存身份。仅在确有意图时删除，方法见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"remove`。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:699
msgid "Installing with npm"
msgstr "使用 npm 安装"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:701
msgid ""
"The npm package ``@agentnetwork/anet`` runs the same release binary. It "
"needs Node.js 18 or later:"
msgstr "npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 运行相同的发布二进制文件，需要 Node.js 18 或更高版本："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:709
msgid ""
"The package contains a launcher and no binary. The build of the platform "
"is in the optional dependency ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>``, as the "
"archive and the signed release manifest. Before the first run of a "
"version, the launcher checks that ``release.json`` carries a valid "
"signature by the ANet release key (the file ``allowed_signers`` of the "
"package) and names the version of the package, and that the SHA-256 "
"digests of the archive and of the binary equal the digests in the "
"manifest. A failure of any check stops the launcher before anything is "
"run. The checked binary is written, with the manifest and its signature, "
"to ``~/.cache/anet/npm/<version>/`` "
"(``~/Library/Caches/anet/npm/<version>/`` on macOS, "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\npm\\<version>`` on Windows, or below "
"``XDG_CACHE_HOME`` when it is set) and is run from there."
msgstr ""
"该包包含一个启动器，不含二进制文件。当前平台的构建位于可选依赖 ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` "
"中，形式为归档和已签名的发布清单。某个版本首次运行之前，启动器检查 ``release.json`` 带有 ANet 发布密钥（包中的 "
"``allowed_signers`` 文件）的有效签名并注明该包的版本，且归档及二进制文件的 SHA-256 "
"摘要与清单中的摘要一致。任何一项检查失败，启动器都会在运行任何程序之前停止。通过检查的二进制文件连同清单及其签名写入 "
"``~/.cache/anet/npm/<version>/``\\ （macOS 上为 "
"``~/Library/Caches/anet/npm/<version>/``\\ ；Windows 上为 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\npm\\<version>``\\ ；设置了 ``XDG_CACHE_HOME`` "
"时位于其下），并从该处运行。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:722
msgid ""
"Update the package with ``npm update --global @agentnetwork/anet``. Do "
"not run ``anet update`` on an installation from npm: the launcher runs "
"the version of the package and replaces a changed binary with that "
"version on its next run. Installations with ``--omit=optional`` lack the "
"build and are refused with a message. The variant with the ``shell`` "
"module is not available through the launcher; install it with "
"``install.sh --shell``, or on Windows with ``install.ps1 -Shell``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``npm update --global @agentnetwork/anet`` 更新该包。不要对通过 npm 安装的 ``anet``"
" 运行 ``anet update``\\ ：启动器运行的是该包的版本，下次运行时会以该版本替换已变更的二进制文件。使用 "
"``--omit=optional`` 的安装缺少构建，启动器会给出提示并拒绝运行。启动器不提供包含 ``shell`` 模块的变体；请使用 "
"``install.sh --shell`` 安装，Windows 上请使用 ``install.ps1 -Shell``\\ 。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:730
msgid ""
"The package also contains ``install.sh`` and ``install.sh.sig``, so that "
"the installer can be obtained from npm when the project hosts cannot be "
"reached, for example from "
"``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@agentnetwork/anet@latest/install.sh``. "
"Verify it as described in :ref:`intro-install-verify` before running it."
msgstr ""
"该包还包含 ``install.sh`` 和 ``install.sh.sig``\\ ，以便在项目主机不可达时从 npm 获取安装程序，例如 "
"``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@agentnetwork/anet@latest/install.sh``\\ "
"。运行之前，请按 :ref:`intro-install-verify` 所述进行验证。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:738
msgid "Checking the installation"
msgstr "检查安装"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:740
msgid ""
"``anet version`` prints the version and the modules that the binary "
"contains. The list is read from the module registry of the running "
"binary, not from a string written at build time."
msgstr "``anet version`` 输出版本以及二进制文件所含的模块。该列表读取自正在运行的二进制文件的模块注册表，而不是构建时写入的字符串。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:754
msgid "Initial configuration"
msgstr "初始配置"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:756
msgid ""
"``anet init`` writes the safe defaults explicitly into ``config.json`` in"
" the data directory, so that each value is visible and changeable instead"
" of existing only as a built-in default. The command is idempotent. It "
"adds keys that are missing and never changes a value that exists. "
"Settings that differ from a fresh installation are listed in its report "
"and left for the operator to decide."
msgstr ""
"``anet init`` 将安全的默认值明确写入数据目录中的 "
"``config.json``，使每个值都可见、可更改，而不是仅作为内置默认值存在。该命令是幂等的：它添加缺失的键，从不更改已存在的值。与全新安装不同的设置会列在其报告中，由运维者自行决定。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:776
msgid "The written values are:"
msgstr "写入的值如下："

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:782
msgid "Key"
msgstr "键"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:783
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:784
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:785
msgid "``inbound.policy``"
msgstr "``inbound.policy``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:786
msgid "``closed``"
msgstr "``closed``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:787
msgid "Only peers on the allow or trust list can send tasks."
msgstr "只有允许列表或信任列表中的对端可以发送任务。"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:788
msgid "``inbound.public_capabilities``"
msgstr "``inbound.public_capabilities``"

#: ../../../../../../../data/projs/anet-dev/wt/v035-integ/docs/intro/install.rst:789
